<section class="gg-ad-landing">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-ad-hero">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Beta Testing</span>
      <h1>Help shape Goal Grower before launch.</h1>
      <p>
        Try early features, tell us what feels confusing, and help build a goal tracker that feels
        calmer, clearer, and easier to return to every day.
      </p>

      <div class="gg-hero-actions">
        <a href="/pages/contact" class="gg-btn">Become a Beta Tester</a>
        <a href="/pages/roadmap" class="gg-btn-soft">See the Roadmap</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-consideration-layout">
      <div class="gg-consideration-card">
        <span class="gg-kicker">Why join?</span>
        <h2>Your feedback directly improves the app.</h2>
        <p>
          You’ll test early ideas, share what feels off, and help make Goal Grower more useful for
          real life instead of just another productivity tool.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-beta-benefits">
        <div><strong>🧪</strong><span>Try new ideas first</span></div>
        <div><strong>📝</strong><span>Share honest feedback</span></div>
        <div><strong>🌱</strong><span>Help progress feel more human</span></div>
        <div><strong>📣</strong><span>Shape what launches next</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-ad-section">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Good fit?</span>
      <h2>Join if you want progress to feel helpful, not pressuring.</h2>
      <p>
        You don’t need to be perfect at goals. Just be willing to try the app and tell us what helps.
      </p>
      <a href="/pages/contact" class="gg-btn">Join the Beta</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Goal Grower Consideration",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Goal Grower Consideration" }]
}
{% endschema %}